        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p><em>Complete Hypnosis: The End.</em> The hypnosis stops being a lie about your position and becomes a lie about everything.</p><p><strong>60-foot emanation</strong>, basic Will, <strong>mental</strong> damage.</p><p>Creatures that fail are <strong>confused</strong> for 1 minute. On a critical failure the creature perceives its own allies as you for that minute and cannot be shaken loose by damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>&#9888; Extrapolated.</strong> Aizen has no canon Final Release, for the same reason he has no canon Bankai.</p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
